# AI
# Curated production rules for AI services used by My / Family profiles.
# Primary discovery source: v2fly/domain-list-community.
# Intentionally excludes broad shared payment, analytics, generic CDN and tracking domains.
#
# Providers: OpenAI / ChatGPT, Anthropic / Claude, Google Gemini / DeepMind,
# xAI / Grok, Perplexity, GitHub Copilot, Microsoft Copilot.

